{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想建立寫日記的習慣，卻總是望著空白頁便放棄？Sundown Journal 以每晚數分鐘的短提問，把「應該多寫日記」變成真正做得到的事，適合生活忙碌、希望在睡前整理思緒與情緒的用家。原價 US $2.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>每晚短提問養成書寫習慣</h2>\n<p>每晚只需數分鐘，Sundown Journal 以短而集中的提問取代空白頁，涵蓋當日重點、情緒、成就、憂慮與明日目標，題目可替換或自訂。連續書寫只計真實完成的日子，達成里程碑會出現慶祝畫面。「On This Day」會對照一年前的記錄，另可加入相片與位置。內容只儲存在裝置上，毋須帳號，亦無雲端同步與廣告追蹤。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-191-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-192-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-193-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-194-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-195-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-196-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Sundown Journal</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T07:58:58.610570+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}